    "notes": "Corrective render-only patch. Diagnostic inspection of plastic_trash_bin.glb found the intended Waste Basket branch plus an unrelated Sphere_1 branch with a ~1989-scale transform. The renderer now removes Sphere_1 before Box3 fitting, so the waste-basket geometry defines scaling and the sphere cannot render. Dimensions, catalog identity, placement, persistence and BOM are unchanged."
